{
  "indexes": [
    {
      "//": "探索頁：跨所有任務找公開的報告。collection group 加上兩個等值條件與排序，這個組合不會自動建立，要明確宣告。",
      "collectionGroup": "reports",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION_GROUP",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "listed",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "active",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "updatedAt",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "每日彙總算「當天最後一次開啟在哪個平台」：lastPlatform 等值 + lastSeenAt 範圍，這個組合要明確宣告。",
      "collectionGroup": "users",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "lastPlatform",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "lastSeenAt",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "後台的使用者詳情：他參與的任務，照最後活動排序。array-contains 加上排序這個組合不會自動建立。",
      "collectionGroup": "tasks",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "memberIds",
          "arrayConfig": "CONTAINS"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "updatedAt",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "稽核日誌的「只看處置／只看檢視」，以及本月次數統計。kind 等值加上時間排序 —— 用 action 前綴過濾的話就得照 action 排，而這份日誌唯一有意義的排序是時間由新到舊。",
      "collectionGroup": "adminLogs",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "kind",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "at",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "後台的任務列表：狀態的四個分頁，照最後活動排序。",
      "collectionGroup": "tasks",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "status",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "updatedAt",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "後台的公開報告：已撤下的那一頁，以及不分狀態的全部。",
      "collectionGroup": "reports",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION_GROUP",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "active",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "updatedAt",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "系統健康：只讀正式環境的樣本，範圍是最近幾天。dev 的數字跑在開發者筆電上，混進來會讓中位數變好看而且是假的。",
      "collectionGroup": "perf",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "mode",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "day",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "任務詳情的分類加總。sum() 聚合要求被加總的欄位也在索引裡 —— 只有 category 的等值索引不夠，這是聚合查詢跟一般查詢不一樣的地方。",
      "collectionGroup": "expenses",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "category",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "baseAmount",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "稽核日誌的本月次數：where kind== and at>= 沒有明寫 orderBy，而沒有明寫時範圍欄位的隱含排序是遞增 —— 所以上面那個 (kind, at DESC) 接不上，兩個都要。",
      "collectionGroup": "adminLogs",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "kind",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "at",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "總覽的「最活躍的任務」：濾掉已刪除的，照支出筆數排。這一份不靠每日彙總，排程還沒跑就已經有東西看。",
      "collectionGroup": "tasks",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "status",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "expenseCount",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "後台 AI 使用報告的「只看某一種類型」：跨所有使用者的點數紀錄，type 等值加上時間由新到舊。",
      "collectionGroup": "aiLedger",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION_GROUP",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "type",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "at",
          "order": "DESCENDING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "後台 AI 設定頁的營收：environment 等值加上 creditedAt 範圍。",
      "collectionGroup": "aiPurchases",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        {
          "fieldPath": "environment",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        },
        {
          "fieldPath": "creditedAt",
          "order": "ASCENDING"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "fieldOverrides": [
    {
      "//": "跨所有任務數當天新增的支出。自動建立的單欄位索引只有 collection 範圍，collection group 要自己開 —— 少了它，那個 count 會直接失敗。",
      "collectionGroup": "expenses",
      "fieldPath": "createdAt",
      "indexes": [
        {
          "order": "ASCENDING",
          "queryScope": "COLLECTION"
        },
        {
          "order": "DESCENDING",
          "queryScope": "COLLECTION"
        },
        {
          "order": "ASCENDING",
          "queryScope": "COLLECTION_GROUP"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "後台的使用者詳情：這個人跨所有任務記過幾筆支出。跟 createdAt 一樣，collection group 範圍要自己開。",
      "collectionGroup": "expenses",
      "fieldPath": "createdBy",
      "indexes": [
        {
          "order": "ASCENDING",
          "queryScope": "COLLECTION"
        },
        {
          "order": "DESCENDING",
          "queryScope": "COLLECTION"
        },
        {
          "order": "ASCENDING",
          "queryScope": "COLLECTION_GROUP"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "公開報告的「全部」那一頁，跨所有任務照最後更新排序。collection group 範圍的單欄位索引要自己開。",
      "collectionGroup": "reports",
      "fieldPath": "updatedAt",
      "indexes": [
        {
          "order": "ASCENDING",
          "queryScope": "COLLECTION"
        },
        {
          "order": "DESCENDING",
          "queryScope": "COLLECTION"
        },
        {
          "order": "DESCENDING",
          "queryScope": "COLLECTION_GROUP"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "//": "後台 AI 使用報告的「全部」：跨所有使用者照時間由新到舊。collection group 範圍的單欄位索引要自己開；使用者詳情只查自己那一份，collection 範圍的兩個照舊留著。",
      "collectionGroup": "aiLedger",
      "fieldPath": "at",
      "indexes": [
        {
          "order": "ASCENDING",
          "queryScope": "COLLECTION"
        },
        {
          "order": "DESCENDING",
          "queryScope": "COLLECTION"
        },
        {
          "order": "DESCENDING",
          "queryScope": "COLLECTION_GROUP"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}